+|---|---|
+| V3 | mitigated (erasure and document deletion can still change or withhold a block) |
+| V6a | mitigated for unchanged data |
+| V7 | mitigated |
+| F6 | partial: cells and documents; not rate numerators, two students together or padding |
+| V6b | **not mitigated** |
+| F8, F7 | open |
