+
+#### Scenario: The identity does not matter
+- **WHEN** two worlds differ only in which student is the heavy one
+- **THEN** the two responses are identical
+
+#### Scenario: No silent change
+- **WHEN** a figure is published
+- **THEN** it equals the count recomputed independently from the facts of the covered weeks
+
