+- **WHEN** four students were active in each week of the block
+- **THEN** `summary_weeks` and every summary figure are null
+
+#### Scenario: Five balanced students
+- **WHEN** five students were active with similar counts in a week
+- **THEN** that week is covered and the summary figures are published
