+`no_cited_source_rate` SHALL be null when a cited answer of the covered weeks cites an unlisted (deleted) document, or when the cited answers that cite a document with a withheld figure exist and come from fewer than 5 students or from one above 50 % of them (rule G3). The rule SHALL depend only on the covered weeks.
